sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CR as Scheduler/Cron
    participant CJ as CostingJob
    participant UR as Usage Repository
    participant PT as Pricing Table
    participant MR as Metrics Repository
    participant EB as Event Bus
    participant N as Notification Service

    Note over CR,CJ: Periodic job to compute cost from usage rollups

    CR->>CJ: triggerCosting(range=from..to, scope=org|team|user)
    CJ->>UR: listUsageRollups(range, scope)
    UR-->>CJ: rollups[{orgId,teamId?,userId?,model,period,qty:{tokensIn,tokensOut,calls}}]

    loop for each rollup
        CJ->>PT: getPrice(model, period)
        PT-->>CJ: {per1kPrompt, per1kCompletion, perCall, currency}

        CJ->>CJ: compute cost = (tokensIn/1000)*per1kPrompt + (tokensOut/1000)*per1kCompletion + calls*perCall

        CJ->>UR: upsertCost(rollupKey, cost, currency)
        UR-->>CJ: ok

        CJ->>MR: upsertCostAggregates(orgId, teamId?, userId?, period, model, cost)
        MR-->>CJ: ok

        CJ->>EB: publish(event="usage.cost.computed", payload={orgId,teamId?,userId?,model,period,cost})
        EB-->>CJ: ack
    end

    opt notify anomalies
        CJ->>MR: getCostAnomalies(range, threshold)
        MR-->>CJ: anomalies[]
        alt anomalies not empty
            CJ->>N: sendEmail(to=FinOps, subject="Cost anomaly detected", body=anomalies)
            N-->>CJ: sent
        else no anomalies
            CJ->>CJ: proceed
        end
    end
